{"articleNo":"465282","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=465282&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[대학본부] [개인정보 유출 모의 훈련] 개인정보유출사실 통지","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2023.10.12","hit":"5859","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><b>※ 본 게시물은 교육부 주관 개인정보 유출 모의훈련 관련 게시글임을 사전에 안내드립니다.&nbsp;</b></span></p><p><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">개인정보 유출 사실을 통지해 드리며 깊은 사죄의 말씀드립니다.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">귀하의 개인정보는 2023년 10월 12일 채용 합격자 명단을&nbsp;작성하면서,</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">숨김처리된 셀 및 시트를 미처 확인하지 못하고</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">홈페이지에 게시하면서&nbsp;유출되었음을 확인하였습니다.</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">유출된 개인정보 항목은 주민등록번호, 이름, 주소, 연락처 등 4개 항목입니다.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">국립금오공과대학교는 유출사실을 인지한 즉시 접속 경로를 차단하고, 취약점 점검과 보완조치를 완료하였습니다.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">피해 확산을 최소화하기 위하여 홈페이지에서 유출여부를 조회해보시것을 권유드리며,</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">귀하께서 국립금오공과대학교 홈페이지와 동일한 ID 및 비밀번호를 사용하고 있는 웹사이트가 있다면,</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">귀하의 계정정보를 변경하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">혹여라도&nbsp;피해가 발생하였거나 기타 궁금하신 사항이 있으시면,&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">아래 담당부서에서&nbsp;접수 후 성실하게 안내와 상담을 해드리고,</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">필요한 조치를 거쳐 손해 배상 등의 구제절차를 진행하도록 하겠습니다.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">앞으로 홈페이지 게시물에 대한 보안 및 개인정보보호 조치강화 등 개인정보에 대한 관리체계를 개선하고,&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">향후 다시는 이와 유사한 사례가 발생하지 않도록 최선을 다하겠습니다.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">귀하께 불편을 드려 재차 진심으로 사과드립니다.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">※ 피해접수 담당부서 및 연락처: 총무과 박진근 주무관/ 054-478-7095</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">※ 개인정보 유출 관련 개인정보 분쟁조정 신청 창구: 1833-6972&nbsp;</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
